      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on an audit for a client's performance review process. i need you to help me summarize some peer feedback. i'll send these in batches. for this first batch, can you summarize the following comments into a concise paragraph for each person, focusing on their professional character and leadership potential?\n\nEmployee: James Sterling\nFeedback: James is always the first to step up during high-pressure situations. He is very direct with his communication and doesn't shy away from difficult conversations. His team knows exactly where they stand with him. He is highly efficient and consistently hits his KPIs.\n\nEmployee: Claire Whitlock\nFeedback: Claire has a very calming influence on the team. She is great at mediating conflicts and ensuring everyone feels heard during meetings. She is very detail-oriented and her reports are always flawless. She is a natural mentor to the junior staff.\n\nEmployee: Robert Vance\nFeedback: Robert is a powerhouse when it comes to technical strategy. He is very authoritative in meetings and can command a room easily. He is extremely driven and expects the same level of excellence from those around him. He has a very strong presence.",
